# SAEA-E21-FULL44-TAIL2S-V1 - the Earnings-21 arm of the cross-carrier
# silence-tail probe (docs/readiness/2026-09-07-cross-carrier-silence-tail-v1-
# preregistration.md sections 1.4, 4.3 and 6.3). NOT AUTHORIZED: this file is
# a launch record, not a permission. The cell needs its own owner GO and its
# own exposure row before the first contact.
#
# Same population, same split identity, same experiment population block, same
# model fragment, same serving geometry (-c 36864 -np 6,
# GGML_CUDA_DISABLE_GRAPHS=1) and the same instruction as the sealed
# comparator SAEA-E21-FULL44-DIRECT-BASELINE-V2. ONE factor moves: the
# baseline fragment's obs_slice_tail_silence_seconds 2.0, which appends
# exactly 2.0 s (32,000 zero samples at 16 kHz) of digital silence to each
# 90-second window AFTER the buffered cut. The cut, the cursor and the window
# spans are untouched, so the cell pairs row for row against the comparator.
#
# Launch with --dataset earnings21-discovery
# --experiment e21-full44-tail2s-v1
# --model q4km-e21-buf90-mmproj-gpu-04ccc72a-np6
# --execution-profile baseline-reproduction
# --planned-model-calls 1750 --planned-gpu-hours 1.2
# --planned-speech-audio-seconds 150000
# run_id:baseline_fragment
